{"id":"ran_she","lemma":"раньше","pos":"adv","rank":190,"glosses":["earlier, before, in the past"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/08/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8C%D1%88%D0%B5.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D0%B0%D0%BD%D1%8C%D1%88%D0%B5.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Почему ты пришел раньше?","en":"Why did you come early?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"you"},null,null]},{"text":"Почему она пришла домой раньше?","en":"Why did she come home early?","words":[{"g":"why"},{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to come , to arrive","l":"прийти"},{"g":"home"},null]},{"text":"Ты знал это раньше?","en":"Did you know that before?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/240592","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]},{"text":"Я был здесь раньше тебя.","en":"I was here before you.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},{"g":"here"},null,{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Это намного лучше, чем раньше.","en":"It's far better than before.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"by far, much"},{"g":"rather, would better )"},{"g":"than"},null]}]}